            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-3-b-2-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "In the old product, Build, Plan and Ask sat in a dropdown. PostHog showed people rarely used Plan or Ask, and some support requests asked for a mode that only answers questions without editing anything. That mode already existed. People just couldn’t find it."
              }
