            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-4-b-1-1-s",
                "marks": [
                  "strong"
                ],
                "text": "The chat stays readable"
              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-4-b-1-1-s1",
                "marks": [],
                "text": " instead of turning into a log."
              }
            ],
            "listItem": "bullet",
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-4-b-1-2",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-4-b-1-2-s",
                "marks": [
                  "strong"
                ],
                "text": "It’s still there to check."
              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-4-b-1-2-s1",
                "marks": [],
                "text": " Expanded, each step gets an icon, and code and commands sit in their own containers."
              }
            ],
            "listItem": "bullet",
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "_type": "mediaImage",
            "_key": "newly-s-4-b-2",
            "localAssetKey": "conversation",
            "alt": "A close-up of a Newly conversation: the user’s message, the agent’s reply, and its work folded into the line Worked for 3m, used 3 tools",
            "caption": "The agent’s work, folded into one line.",
            "size": "full"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "projectSection",
        "_key": "newly-section-5",
        "title": "Simulator picker",
        "heading": "A clearer simulator picker",
        "content": [
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-5-b-0",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-5-b-0-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "The preview runs your app on an iPhone simulator, in the cloud or on your computer. The simulator picker went through eight versions."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-5-b-1",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-5-b-1-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Tester feedback and my own critique pointed to two problems:"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-5-b-2-0",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-5-b-2-0-s",
                "marks": [
                  "strong"
                ],
                "text": "Unclear what was selected →"
              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-5-b-2-0-s1",
                "marks": [],
                "text": " Cloud and Local got their own column, and the columns got labels: Type, Device, Version."
              }
            ],
            "listItem": "bullet",
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-5-b-2-1",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-5-b-2-1-s",
                "marks": [
                  "strong"
                ],
                "text": "Unclear what Apply did →"
              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-5-b-2-1-s1",
                "marks": [],
                "text": " it re-runs the app, so Apply became Apply & Run."
              }
            ],
            "listItem": "bullet",
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "_type": "mediaImage",
            "_key": "newly-s-5-b-3",
            "localAssetKey": "picker-versions",
            "alt": "Four versions of the iOS simulator picker, from a footer Cloud/Local toggle and an Apply button to labelled Type, Device and Version columns with Apply & Run",
            "caption": "Four of the eight versions.",
            "size": "full"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "projectSection",
        "_key": "newly-section-6",
        "title": "Also shipped",
        "heading": "Deploy, web and colour",
        "content": [
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-6-b-0",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-6-b-0-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "I designed and built the deploy and web screens, and both are live."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-6-b-1-0",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-6-b-1-0-s",
                "marks": [
                  "strong"
                ],
                "text": "Deploy"
              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-6-b-1-0-s1",
                "marks": [],
                "text": " groups destinations by platform. The App Store card shows a short checklist and the details already filled in."
              }
            ],
            "listItem": "bullet",
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-6-b-1-1",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-6-b-1-1-s",
                "marks": [
                  "strong"
                ],
                "text": "The web app"
              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-6-b-1-1-s1",
                "marks": [],
                "text": " opens with a “Pick up where you left off” card to reopen your last project."
              }
            ],
            "listItem": "bullet",
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-6-b-1-2",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-6-b-1-2-s",
                "marks": [
                  "strong"
                ],
                "text": "Colour"
              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-6-b-1-2-s1",
                "marks": [],
                "text": " is held back in the workspace. Blue only marks the active mode, the main action and anything running, so your own app stands out."
              }
            ],
            "listItem": "bullet",
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "_type": "mediaGallery",
            "_key": "newly-s-6-b-2",
            "caption": "The Deploy hub, the App Store release card and the web welcome screen.",
            "images": [
              {
                "_type": "image",
                "_key": "newly-s-6-b-2-0",
                "localAssetKey": "deploy-hub",
                "alt": "The Newly Deploy hub with iOS, Android and Web destinations"
              },
              {
                "_type": "image",
                "_key": "newly-s-6-b-2-1",
                "localAssetKey": "deploy-release",
                "alt": "The App Store release card with a checklist and an Automatically Completed list"
              },
              {
                "_type": "image",
                "_key": "newly-s-6-b-2-2",
                "localAssetKey": "web-welcome",
                "alt": "Newly on the web: the welcome screen with a filled prompt and a Pick up where you left off card"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "projectSection",
        "_key": "newly-section-7",
        "title": "Outcome",
        "heading": "What shipped and what I learned",
        "content": [
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-7-b-0",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-7-b-0-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "The workspace, the prompt bar and its states, the deploy flow and the web app are all live."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-7-b-1",
            "style": "h3",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-7-b-1-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "What feedback changed"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-7-b-2-0",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-7-b-2-0-s",
                "marks": [
                  "strong"
                ],
                "text": "Shaped by feedback:"
              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-7-b-2-0-s1",
                "marks": [],
                "text": " chat over the board, one sidebar instead of two, and Apply & Run in the simulator picker."
              }
            ],
            "listItem": "bullet",
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-7-b-2-1",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-7-b-2-1-s",
                "marks": [
                  "strong"
                ],
                "text": "After shipping:"
              },
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-7-b-2-1-s1",
                "marks": [],
                "text": " people stopped getting stuck on the simulator picker."
              }
            ],
            "listItem": "bullet",
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-7-b-3",
            "style": "h3",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-7-b-3-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "What I learned"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-7-b-4-0",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-7-b-4-0-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Designing for an agent is mostly states, not screens."
              }
            ],
            "listItem": "bullet",
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-7-b-4-1",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-7-b-4-1-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "A good idea can still be wrong for the timeline. The board may come back."
              }
            ],
            "listItem": "bullet",
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-7-b-5",
            "style": "h3",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-7-b-5-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Summary"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-7-b-6",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-7-b-6-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "One prompt in Newly drives sessions, a simulator, models and App Store releases, for technical and non-technical people. As the only designer, I designed the workspace around that prompt bar. I also built the layout, the prompt bar, and the deploy and web screens in React and TypeScript."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_type": "block",
            "_key": "newly-s-7-b-7",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "newly-s-7-b-7-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Feedback and the team’s priorities changed the plan more than once along the way. What shipped helped grow Newly’s revenue."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
